# 效果 ret_ptr：被调者返回实参指针（或它所指结构体的指针字段）加偏移（oobsum/specs/SPEC-0070；06- D-24、A-63、A-70）。
# 原来调用方拿到的是未知指针，只能记 untracked_pointer。
#
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ReportSafe=true \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:Dump=summary -analyzer-config 'rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:DumpFilter=^(Msg_Body|Ctx_Tail|Wrap|Pick)$' \
# RUN:   %S/Inputs/retptr/r.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:summary] {{.*}}"effs":[{"kind":"ret_ptr","target":"p0","value":"4"}],{{.*}}"fn":"Msg_Body"
CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:summary] {{.*}}"effs":[{"kind":"ret_ptr","target":"p0->pucBuf","value":"4"}],{{.*}}"fn":"Ctx_Tail"
CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:summary] {{.*}}"effs":[{"kind":"ret_ptr","target":"p0","value":"6"}],{{.*}}"fn":"Wrap"
# 偏移不同但都是常数：记 range（SPEC-0094；原来不记）；调用方按偏移区间判（SPEC-0095）→ POSSIBLE
CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:summary] {{.*}}"effs":[{"kind":"ret_ptr","range":["2","6"],"target":"p0"}],{{.*}}"fn":"Pick"
CHECK-DAG: r.c:15:1: warning: [OOB-POSSIBLE] Possible out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 19 of 'a' (16 bytes) may be accessed; the bound comes from a branch constant
CHECK-DAG: r.c:7:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 13 of 'a' (12 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: r.c:8:1: warning: [OOB-SAFE:within] Proven within bounds: up to byte 12 of 'a' (12 bytes)
CHECK-DAG: r.c:10:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 13 of 'a' (12 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: r.c:12:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 11 of 'a' (10 bytes) is accessed
